    <content>
        <description>
            <levelledPara>
                <para>The Stratos Compact UAV is an electrically powered unmanned aerial vehicle
                    designed for aerial survey, reconnaissance, and inspection operations. It has a
                    maximum takeoff weight of 2.8 kg, a wingspan of 1.2 m, and an operational
                    endurance of 45 minutes per battery charge under standard conditions.</para>
            </levelledPara>
            <levelledPara>
                <para>The vehicle operates autonomously using pre-programmed flight plans or can be
                    manually controlled via the Stratos Ground Control Station (GCS). All flight
                    data, including GPS position, altitude, and battery status, is transmitted to
                    the GCS in real time via an encrypted 2.4 GHz radio link.</para>
            </levelledPara>
            <levelledPara>
                <para>The Stratos is composed of four primary systems: the propulsion system, which
                    includes twin counter-rotating brushless motors and an electronic speed
                    controller; the avionics system, which includes the flight controller, GPS
                    receiver, and inertial measurement unit; the power system, which includes the
                    lithium polymer battery and power distribution board; and the payload bay, which
                    accommodates interchangeable sensor modules up to 400 g.</para>
            </levelledPara>
            <levelledPara>
                <title>Operating Limits</title>
                <para>The Stratos is certified for operations within the following environmental limits:</para>
                <para>
                    <randomList>
                        <listItem><para>Maximum wind speed: 10 m/s</para></listItem>
                        <listItem><para>Operating temperature: -10°C to +45°C</para></listItem>
                        <listItem><para>Maximum altitude above sea level: 3,000 m</para></listItem>
                        <listItem><para>Minimum visibility: 500 m</para></listItem>
                    </randomList>
                </para>
            </levelledPara>
        </description>
